{"The constructor type now allows `scope: \"team\"` without `teamId`, but the schema parse still requires `teamId` for that scope. A caller can now pass a value that TypeScript accepts and get a runtime Zod throw during construction instead of a compile-time error.": 0.9523965716362, "When org or team authorization is returned without filters, this branch can return a top-level `OR` fragment without outer parentheses. A raw-query caller that appends another condition as `WHERE ${baseConditions} AND ...` gets `team_match OR user_match AND ...`, so the appended restriction only applies to part of the authorization check.": 0.9539724588394165}